     "text": {
      "title": "你好",
      "body": "“你好！请问，你是王老师吗？”\n“不是，我不是王老师。”\n“对不起！”\n“没关系。”\n“请问，你是老师吗？”\n“是，我也是老师。”\n“谢谢你！再见！”\n“不客气。再见！”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“Hello! Excuse me, are you Teacher Wang?”\n“No, I'm not Teacher Wang.”\n“Sorry!”\n“That's all right.”\n“Excuse me, are you a teacher?”\n“Yes, I'm a teacher too.”\n“Thank you! Goodbye!”\n“You're welcome. Goodbye!”"
      }
     }
