     "text": {
      "title": "你叫什么名字？",
      "body": "“你好！请问，你叫什么名字？”\n“我叫王明。你呢？”\n“我叫文文，我是中国人。你也是中国人吗？”\n“是，我也是。这是什么字？”\n“这是‘文’，文文的‘文’。”\n“他是你先生吗？”\n“是，他是我先生。他也是中国人。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“Hello! Excuse me, what's your name?”\n“My name is Wang Ming. And yours?”\n“My name is Wenwen. I'm Chinese. Are you Chinese too?”\n“Yes, I am too. What character is this?”\n“It's ‘wen’, the ‘wen’ in Wenwen.”\n“Is he your husband?”\n“Yes, he's my husband. He's Chinese too.”"
      }
     }
