     "text": {
      "title": "我的家人",
      "body": "这是我的家人。这是我爸爸，这是我妈妈。我有哥哥，也有妹妹。这是我哥哥，这是我的小妹妹。我哥哥的女朋友是中国人，她也是我的好朋友。爸爸妈妈都很爱我们。我爱我的家！",
      "translation": {
       "en": "This is my family. This is my dad, and this is my mum. I have an older brother and a younger sister. This is my brother, and this is my little sister. My brother's girlfriend is Chinese; she is a good friend of mine too. Mum and Dad both love us very much. I love my family!"
      }
