     "text": {
      "title": "你妹妹几岁？",
      "body": "“你家有几口人？”\n“七口人。”\n“你妹妹几岁？”\n“她四岁。我弟弟七岁。”\n“你哥哥呢？”\n“我哥哥十九岁，我姐姐二十一岁。”\n“你爸爸妈妈多大？”\n“我爸爸四十八岁，我妈妈四十六岁。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“How many people are there in your family?”\n“Seven.”\n“How old is your little sister?”\n“She's four. My little brother is seven.”\n“And your older brother?”\n“My older brother is nineteen, and my older sister is twenty-one.”\n“How old are your parents?”\n“My dad is forty-eight, and my mum is forty-six.”"
      }
     },
