     "text": {
      "title": "今天几号？",
      "body": "“今天几号？”\n“今天十号，星期三。”\n“明天是星期四吧？”\n“对。明天是我妈妈的生日。”\n“她今年多大？”\n“她今年五十岁。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“What's the date today?”\n“Today is the tenth, a Wednesday.”\n“Tomorrow is Thursday, right?”\n“That's right. Tomorrow is my mum's birthday.”\n“How old is she this year?”\n“She's fifty this year.”"
      }
