     "text": {
      "title": "我的时间",
      "body": "“你几点起床？”\n“我六点起床。”\n“你几点睡觉？”\n“我晚上十一点睡觉。”\n“你明天下午有时间吗？”\n“有，三点以后可以。”\n“好，明天见！”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“What time do you get up?”\n“I get up at six.”\n“What time do you go to bed?”\n“I go to bed at eleven at night.”\n“Do you have time tomorrow afternoon?”\n“Yes, any time after three.”\n“Great, see you tomorrow!”"
      }
     }
