     "text": {
      "title": "你吃什么？",
      "body": "“你吃什么？”\n“我吃包子。你呢？”\n“我不要包子，我要饺子。”\n“你会做饺子吗？”\n“我妈妈会做，我不会。”\n“我有一点儿面包，你吃吗？”\n“谢谢，我不吃了。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“What are you eating?”\n“I'm having baozi. And you?”\n“I don't want baozi, I want dumplings.”\n“Can you make dumplings?”\n“My mum can; I can't.”\n“I have a little bread. Would you like some?”\n“Thanks, but I'm fine.”"
      }
     }
