     "text": {
      "title": "在饭店",
      "body": "“你们好！请问，你们喝什么？”\n“我喝茶。”\n“我要一杯牛奶。”\n“你们吃什么？”\n“我们要两碗米饭和一个菜。”\n“好的。我们的面条儿也很好吃。”\n“那再要一碗面条儿。谢谢！”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“Hello! What would you like to drink?”\n“Tea for me.”\n“I'd like a glass of milk.”\n“And to eat?”\n“Two bowls of rice and one dish, please.”\n“Sure. Our noodles are very good too.”\n“Then a bowl of noodles as well. Thank you!”"
      }
