     "text": {
      "title": "这件衣服多少钱？",
      "body": "“请问，这件衣服多少钱？”\n“两百块。”\n“太贵了！那件呢？”\n“那件很便宜，八十块。”\n“我看看……我觉得这件也很好看。”\n“你穿这件很好看！”\n“好，我买这件。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“Excuse me, how much is this top?”\n“Two hundred yuan.”\n“That's too expensive! What about that one?”\n“That one's cheap: eighty yuan.”\n“Let me see… I think this one looks nice too.”\n“It looks great on you!”\n“OK, I'll take this one.”"
      }
