     "text": {
      "title": "我的学校",
      "body": "我是大学生。我们学校很大，学生很多。我们的汉语老师是中国人，她很好。上课的时候，我们读书、写汉字。下课以后，我和同学一起学习。我爱我的学校。",
      "translation": {
       "en": "I'm a university student. Our school is big and has lots of students. Our Chinese teacher is Chinese, and she is very nice. In class we read aloud from our books and write Chinese characters. After class I study with my classmates. I love my school."
