     "text": {
      "title": "你怎么去？",
      "body": "“明天你去哪儿？”\n“我去北京。”\n“你怎么去？坐飞机吗？”\n“不，我坐火车去。”\n“你什么时候回来？”\n“星期五回来。我爸爸开车去北京，我坐他的车回来。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“Where are you going tomorrow?”\n“I'm going to Beijing.”\n“How are you getting there? By plane?”\n“No, I'm going by train.”\n“When are you coming back?”\n“On Friday. My dad is driving to Beijing, and I'll come back in his car.”"
      }
     }
