     ],
     "text": {
      "title": "今天天气怎么样？",
      "body": "“喂，你好！你那儿天气怎么样？”\n“今天很冷，现在下雪了。”\n“我这儿很热，下午下雨了。”\n“你想来我这儿吗？”\n“想！我很想看雪。”\n“好，你明年一月来吧！”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“Hello! What's the weather like where you are?”\n“It's very cold today. It's snowing now.”\n“It's very hot here. It rained in the afternoon.”\n“Would you like to come here?”\n“Yes! I'd love to see snow.”\n“OK, come next January!”"
      }
     }
