     "text": {
      "title": "我病了",
      "body": "“你怎么了？”\n“我生病了，不想吃饭。”\n“你去医院看病了吗？”\n“去了。医生说我要多喝水，多休息。”\n“你现在怎么样？”\n“好一点儿了。谢谢你！”\n“不客气。听医生的，早点儿睡觉。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“What's wrong?”\n“I'm ill and I don't feel like eating.”\n“Did you go to the hospital to see a doctor?”\n“I did. The doctor said I need to drink a lot of water and rest a lot.”\n“How are you now?”\n“A little better. Thank you!”\n“You're welcome. Do what the doctor says and go to bed early.”"
      }
