     "text": {
      "title": "医院在哪儿？",
      "body": "“请问，医院离这儿近吗？”\n“很近。你看，前面有一家超市，医院在超市的左边。”\n“左边还是右边？”\n“左边。超市右边是一家书店，后面是一个学校。”\n“谢谢你！”\n“不客气。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“Excuse me, is the hospital near here?”\n“Very near. Look, there's a supermarket ahead; the hospital is to the left of the supermarket.”\n“Left or right?”\n“Left. To the right of the supermarket is a bookshop, and behind it is a school.”\n“Thank you!”\n“You're welcome.”"
      }
     }
    },
