      "过",
      "场"
     ],
     "text": {
      "title": "去机场",
      "body": "明天我要去机场。我家离地铁站很近，一出门就能看见车站。坐地铁去机场很便宜，我不想打车，也不想坐公交车。回来的时候东西多，我就打车回家。",
      "translation": {
       "en": "Tomorrow I'm going to the airport. My home is very close to the metro station: as soon as I step out of the door I can see it. Taking the metro to the airport is cheap, so I don't want to take a taxi or the bus. On the way back I'll have a lot of luggage, so I'll take a taxi home."
      }
     }
    },
