      "眼",
      "睛"
     ],
     "text": {
      "title": "我的爱好",
      "body": "我的爱好是跑步。星期六上午我去跑步，下午去踢球。跑步很累，可是很舒服。我哥哥个子很高，他喜欢打篮球，打得非常好。我妹妹喜欢跳舞。",
      "translation": {
       "en": "My hobby is running. On Saturday mornings I go running, and in the afternoon I play football. Running is tiring, but it feels great. My older brother is tall; he likes playing basketball and plays really well. My little sister likes dancing."
      }
     }
