      "表",
      "颜"
     ],
     "text": {
      "title": "什么颜色？",
      "body": "“你喜欢什么颜色？”\n“我喜欢红色和绿色。”\n“这块红色的手表怎么样？”\n“颜色不错，可是有点儿贵。”\n“那块黑色的比这块便宜。”\n“好啊，我买黑色的。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“What colours do you like?”\n“I like red and green.”\n“What about this red watch?”\n“The colour is nice, but it's a bit expensive.”\n“The black one is cheaper than this one.”\n“OK, I'll buy the black one.”"
      }
     }
