     ],
     "text": {
      "title": "考试",
      "body": "明天我们有汉语考试。今天下午，我在教室里看了看本子上的新词，写了写汉字。有的词我不认识，我去问老师是什么意思。老师说：“你学得很好，别怕。”考试以后，我想好好休息。",
      "translation": {
       "en": "Tomorrow we have a Chinese exam. This afternoon in the classroom I looked over the new words in my notebook and wrote out some characters. There were some words I didn't know, so I went to ask the teacher what they meant. The teacher said, “You're doing very well. Don't be afraid.” After the exam I want to have a good rest."
      }
     }
