      "周"
     ],
     "text": {
      "title": "我的生日",
      "body": "我的生日快要到了。我从小就喜欢过生日。小时候，妈妈每年都给我做一个大蛋糕。现在我已经是大学生了，不能经常回家。今年过生日的时候，我要回家跟爸爸妈妈吃饭。",
      "translation": {
       "en": "My birthday is coming soon. I've loved birthdays since I was little. When I was a child, my mum made me a big cake every year. Now I'm at university and can't go home often. This year for my birthday I'm going home to have a meal with my parents."
      }
     },
     "focus": "listening"
    },
