      "己"
     ],
     "text": {
      "title": "我的好朋友",
      "body": "我的好朋友姓王，她是一个快乐的女孩儿，很爱笑。她的爷爷奶奶住在我家旁边，我们从小就认识。星期天我们经常一起玩。我们是好朋友，也像一家人。",
      "translation": {
       "en": "My good friend's surname is Wang. She's a cheerful girl who loves to laugh. Her grandparents live next door to us, and we've known each other since we were little. On Sundays we often play together. We're good friends, and we're like family too."
      }
     }
    },
