      "情",
      "送",
      "完",
      "准",
      "备"
     ],
     "text": {
      "title": "帮妈妈",
      "body": "“妈妈，我可以帮忙吗？”\n“好啊。你帮我打开门吧，我拿着东西呢。”\n“还要我做什么？”\n“饭好了，你去洗手，准备吃饭吧。”\n“洗完了。我们等爸爸吗？”\n“等一下吧，他快要到门口了。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“Mum, can I help?”\n“Yes, please. Open the door for me; my hands are full.”\n“What else can I do?”\n“The food's ready. Go and wash your hands and get ready to eat.”\n“Done. Shall we wait for Dad?”\n“Let's wait a bit; he's almost at the door.”"
      }
     }
    },
