      "路",
      "慢",
      "每",
      "肉",
      "药",
      "运"
     ],
     "text": {
      "title": "在饭馆",
      "body": "“你喝什么？咖啡还是茶？”\n“我不喝咖啡，我要一杯绿茶。你呢？”\n“我要奶茶。我们吃什么？”\n“这家饭馆的肉很好吃。”\n“我知道，但是我不能多吃肉。医生让我少吃肉，多吃菜，多运动。”\n“那我们还是吃菜吧。”",
      "translation": {
       "en": "“What will you drink? Coffee or tea?”\n“I don't drink coffee. I'd like a cup of green tea. And you?”\n“Milk tea for me. What shall we eat?”\n“The meat at this restaurant is really good.”\n“I know, but I can't eat much meat. My doctor told me to eat less meat, more vegetables, and get more exercise.”\n“Then we'd better have vegetable dishes.”"
      }
     },
     "focus": "speaking"
    },
