     "text": {
      "title": "晴天",
      "body": "今天是晴天，不冷也不热，所以我们出去看花。外面的花很多，很漂亮。树上有很多鸟，水里有鱼。虽然明天可能是阴天，但是我们还是想出去玩。",
      "translation": {
       "en": "Today is sunny, neither cold nor hot, so we're going out to look at the flowers. There are lots of flowers outside, and they're beautiful. There are many birds in the trees and fish in the water. Although it may be cloudy tomorrow, we still want to go out."
      }
     }
