     ],
     "text": {
      "title": "第一次出国",
      "body": "我还没有出过国。今年过年，我想出国旅游。我已经买了机票，也找好了酒店。酒店离海不远，我每天都可以去游泳。朋友说那儿很有意思。因为是第一次出国，我非常高兴。",
      "translation": {
       "en": "I've never been abroad. This Chinese New Year I'd like to travel abroad. I've already bought my plane ticket and found a hotel. The hotel isn't far from the sea, so I can go swimming every day. My friend says it's a really interesting place. Because it's my first trip abroad, I'm really happy."
      }
     }
