     "text": {
      "title": "我的希望",
      "body": "我希望明年去中国学习汉语。老师告诉我，在中国可以多说、多听，这样学汉语最快。我也想上网认识一些中国朋友，请他们给我介绍一下中国。我还记得第一次说汉语的时候，什么都听不懂。现在我懂得多了！",
      "translation": {
       "en": "I hope to go to China next year to study Chinese. My teacher told me that in China you can speak and listen a lot, and that this is the fastest way to learn Chinese. I'd also like to make some Chinese friends online and ask them to tell me about China. I still remember that the first time I spoke Chinese, I couldn't understand a thing. Now I understand much more!"
      }
     }
